<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SJD School Events</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f2f5fa;
      color: #243047;
    }

    header {
      background: #15366b;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 35px 20px;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    header p {
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 0 18px;
    }

    .notice {
      background: white;
      border-left: 5px solid #e5a52b;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .events {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .event {
      background: white;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #00000010;
    }

    .event h3 {
      color: #15366b;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e5edfc;
      color: #15366b;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      color: #566176;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>SJD School Events</h1>
    <p>Know what's happening. Know what to bring. Never miss a date.</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="notice">
      <h2>Welcome!</h2>
      <p>Find important event dates, deadlines, and reminders in one place.</p>
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> This is a practice website. Event details must be verified with the school.</p>
    </section>

    <h2>Upcoming Events</h2>

    <section class="events">
      <article class="event">
        <span class="tag">Practice example</span>
        <h3>School Event 1</h3>
        <p><strong>Date:</strong> To be announced</p>
        <p><strong>What to do:</strong> Check official school announcements.</p>
        <p><strong>Bring or pay:</strong> Confirm with the school.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="event">
        <span class="tag">Practice example</span>
        <h3>School Event 2</h3>
        <p><strong>Date:</strong> To be announced</p>
        <p><strong>What to do:</strong> Check whether registration is required.</p>
        <p><strong>Bring or pay:</strong> Confirm with the school.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="event">
        <span class="tag">Practice example</span>
        <h3>School Event 3</h3>
        <p><strong>Date:</strong> To be announced</p>
        <p><strong>What to do:</strong> Watch for official reminders.</p>
        <p><strong>Bring or pay:</strong> Confirm with the school.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    SJD Event Communication Project | Student Practice Website
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
